OL,3,GNEWSAFree school milk scheme could end
OL,4,Aafter 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FGenerations of Welsh children have
OL,7,Fenjoyed free school milk - but the
OL,8,Fscheme could come to an end next year.
OL,10,FIt was in 1977 that the current School
OL,11,FMilk Subsidy Scheme (SMSS) was
OL,12,Flaunched, covering youngsters aged four
OL,13,Fto 11.
OL,15,FBut, from 2027, the UK government
OL,16,Fagency that administers it will no
OL,17,Flonger do so, meaning the Welsh
OL,18,Fgovernment is looking at two options -
OL,19,Fcreating a new grant-funded model or
OL,20,Fdiscontinuing it.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
